00:19:16.348 --> 00:19:17.922
I really, really, really appreciate it.

00:19:17.922 --> 00:19:19.340
So thank you guys again for watching.

00:19:19.340 --> 00:19:20.623
I believe in you.

00:19:20.623 --> 00:19:22.490
I hope you continue to believe in yourself

00:19:22.490 --> 00:19:24.628
and whatever your one word is.

00:19:24.628 --> 00:19:25.461
Much love.

